  "rationale": [
    "The missing org.slf4j.LoggerFactory class belongs to slf4j-api, and the actual cached1.7.36 JAR contains it.",
    "Both Recipe and ClasspathScanningLoader initialization fail inside the exported OpenRewrite-backed recipe runtime.",
    "Successful migration tests receive API1.7.36 only via test-scoped rewrite-test8.17.1; that dependency is not propagated to A3.",
    "Runtime scope on migration-recipes supplies its own exported runtime requirement and propagates to downstream A3 test/runtime classpaths without broadening compile dependencies. Existing compilation already passed; neither module directly imports SLF4J in main sources.",
    "The actual51-entry migration test classpath contains no SLF4J1 binding class or SLF4J2 provider service among its JARs. A binding is not established as necessary by these failures.",
    "Keep OpenRewrite8.17.1 and the already resolved API1.7.36 pin. Adding task-specific slf4j-simple2.0.13 would add an unneeded backend and version change."
  ],
